    "raw_text": "\nmulti-dimensional analysis:\nLet me analyze this video based on the provided frames and the text prompt. The prompt asks for \"a 15-second, 1:1 square-framed, real-person agricultural brand documentary shot in bright midday sun in a vineyard.\" Let me examine each dimension:\n\nVisual Quality Analysis:\nThe overall visual quality is moderate (3/5). The frames show decent resolution with occasional softness and minor compression artifacts that slightly affect sharpness. Lighting remains natural and consistent with bright midday sun, and color grading is stable across scenes. There are no major distortions or abrupt frame-to-frame changes, and the composition stays coherent throughout. Overall, the video presents a credible look but does not reach high-end clarity.\n\nText-to-Video Alignment Analysis:\nThe video aligns well with the prompt requirements. It features a real person in an agricultural setting, framed in a 1:1 square aspect ratio, under bright daylight, in a vineyard with visible rows and grape clusters. The subject wears appropriate work attire and performs plausible field actions, including examining grapes and walking through the rows. The sequence progresses logically from general field inspection to close-up details of the crop, maintaining alignment with the requested content. Minor deviations may exist in exact framing or pacing, but they do not significantly detract from overall alignment.\n\nPhysical Consistency / Common-sense:\nThe scene generally adheres to physical realism and common-sense expectations: daylight, outdoor shadows, and interactions with the vines appear believable. However, there are a few subtle inconsistencies in motion dynamics and hand positioning during close-ups that prevent a perfect match to real-world physics. These small issues keep the overall physical consistency at a moderate level.\n</think>\n\n(1) visual quality: 3\n(2) text-to-video alignment: 4\n(3) physical/common-sense consistency: 3\n"
